// Splice's shaders (splice.coax, docs/verse/art-styles.md, Anime): the same anime scene, ink and
// post pass as Anime Lab, so this file loads Anime Lab's. build.sh writes apps/openagents-web/splice.wgsl
// from it with coax/web/wgsl-module.coax (splice.module, and animelab.bindings, which the two share).
// No WGSL is written by hand.
#load "animelab.coax";
